267 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 205 0 R
/ActualText (The goal of the Official Development Assistance supported KRW 25.5 billion \(approx. US$20 million\) SMART-C Programme is to promote sustainable maritime transport systems and a sustainable marine environment, by long-term programming of several technical cooperation projects.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [16]
>>
