<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 206 0 R
/ActualText (The Sustainable Maritime Transport Training Programme \(GHG-SMART\), funded by the Republic of Korea and launched on 28 October 2020, aims to support the implementation of the IMO GHG Strategy by initiating capacity-building activities for Small  Island  Developing  States  \(SIDS\)  and  Least  Developed)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
