/P 207 0 R
/ActualText (Countries \(LDCs\) through a series of training courses and industry visits, with the purpose of building sufficient human capacity in these countries.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
296 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 207 0 R
/ActualText (Participants come from a range of different stakeholders, including policy makers, public authorities and industry \(shipping, ports and ship building\).)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
