/T (Somalia)
/E (Somalia)
/Pg 15 0 R
>>
endobj
385 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 211 0 R
/ActualText (Efforts to safeguard the Red Sea area from strategic threats remains a concern.  Such threats could undermine the value of the maritime sector and the blue economy in the countries of the region. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
386 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 211 0 R
/ActualText ( )
/Pg 15 0 R
>>
