<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 215 0 R
/ActualText (Preparation for a possible marine oil spill incident is crucial. Mauritania is being supported to develop its National Oil Spill Contingency Plan \(NOSCP\) - the foundation of an effective and sustainable oil spill preparedness and response framework.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
453 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 215 0 R
/ActualText (An in-person national workshop in Nouakchott, Mauritania \(20-24 November\), has been delivered under the framework of the GI WACAF Project, which works to enhance the capacity of partner countries to prepare for and respond to marine oil spills. The workshop was designed to support effective implementation of the International Convention on Oil Pollution Preparedness, Response and Co-operation \(OPRC\).)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
