/S /P
/P 217 0 R
/ActualText (Attendees of both Conferences were familiarized with the newly adopted Global Strategy for the IMO WIMAs \(TC 73/16, annex 1\), to be implemented from 2024 onwards; and the 2023 IMO GHG Strategy, among other topics.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
486 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 217 0 R
/ActualText (The Programme granted fellowships to three women from developing countries to complete the IALA World-Wide Academy aids to navigation training.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [13]
>>
